I walk into a large clothing shop in the city.
I shake off the cold.
In here, it is wonderfully warm.
The shop has a large selection of winter clothes.
I look for a shop assistant.
A friendly woman smiles at me.
"Hi, can I help you?" she asks.
"Yes please," I answer.
"I am freezing, and I need help."
"I am looking for a thick sweater."
The assistant nods and looks at my thin clothes.
"We have a good selection of woolen sweaters right here," she says.
I quickly find a thick, soft woolen sweater.
"I also need a warm jacket," I say.
"A really warm winter jacket."
"Of course," the assistant smiles.
"We will surely find a warm set of clothes for you."
"Come with me."
She shows me the way over to the large jackets.
